        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): truncate multibyte middleware details at byte limit",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where tools returning non-ASCII result details could send more than the 100 KB details limit into agent tool-result middleware because the limit was measured in UTF-16 code units instead of serialized UTF-8 bytes.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe shared middleware details validator now enforces the existing cap against the exact serialized UTF-8 byte length while retaining the current type, depth, cycle, and key-count checks. The incoming-details sanitizer uses the same byte measure for truncation and reports the accurate original byte size.\n\n## User Impact\n\nAgent tool-result middleware now receives consistently bounded details for multibyte payloads, and oversized details are replaced with an accurate truncation marker instead of bypassing the configured byte limit.\n\n## Evidence\n\nValidated at head `f6fc735f81f8808a08a917f9e902b19d02d145dc`.\n\nClaim proved: the production OpenClaw tool-result middleware runner replaces an actual multibyte details payload with the accurate truncation marker before a registered middleware observes it.\n\nDirect runtime command: `node --import tsx --input-type=module -`, importing `src/agents/harness/tool-result-middleware.ts` and calling `createAgentToolResultMiddlewareRunner(...).applyToolResultMiddleware(...)` with 60,000 `\\u00e9` characters.\n\nObserved terminal output:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"runtime\": \"openclaw\",\n  \"serializedInputBytes\": 120011,\n  \"middlewareObservedDetails\": {\n    \"truncated\": true,\n    \"originalSizeBytes\": 120011\n  },\n  \"returnedDetails\": {\n    \"truncated\": true,\n    \"originalSizeBytes\": 120011\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAdditional focused validation:\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/harness/tool-result-middleware.test.ts` — 25 tests passed.\n- `node_modules/.bin/oxlint.CMD src/agents/harness/tool-result-middleware.ts src/agents/harness/tool-result-middleware.test.ts` — clean.\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD` — clean.\n- `python .agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode local` — no accepted/actionable findings on the code change.\n",
        "branch": "codex/fix-middleware-details-byte-limit",
